<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trans World Air started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trans World Air started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs started coverage of Trans World Airlines Inc as market underperform, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 12 Monday.</p>
</text>
